  "question": {
    "text": "A light string passing over a smooth light pulley connects two blocks of masses $m_1$ and $m_2$ (where $m_2>m_1$ ). If the acceleration of the system is $\\frac{g}{\\sqrt{2}}$, then the ratio of the masses $\\frac{m_1}{m_2}$ is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "DVht0",
      "text": "$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{5}-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0h5wT",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{\\sqrt{2}+1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JTzkK",
      "text": "$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{2}-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "whG9c",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{\\sqrt{2}-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7CUDJBw-biboykwUerdWV9xEQl9Bxqq3R1XS_A1POJ4.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & a=\\left(\\frac{M_2-M_1}{M_1+M_2}\\right) g \\\\ & \\frac{g}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\left(\\frac{M_2-M_1}{M_1+M_2}\\right) g \\\\ & \\left(M_1+M_2\\right)=\\sqrt{2} M_2-\\sqrt{2} M_1 \\\\ & \\frac{M_1}{M_2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{\\sqrt{2}+1}\\right)\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
